        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "MPS are delighted to present this charming three-bedroom end-of-terrace residence to the market.\r\n\r\nExtending to approximately 78 sq. m (840 sq. ft.), the accommodation is well laid out and briefly comprises an entrance hallway, spacious open-plan living/dining room and kitchen at ground floor level, with three bedrooms and a family shower room on the first floor.\r\n\r\nThe property benefits from oil-fired central heating and double-glazed windows and doors. While requiring light modernisation and cosmetic upgrading throughout, it offers an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, investors, or those seeking to create a home tailored to their own tastes and requirements. \r\n\r\nImportantly, the property may qualify for the Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant (subject to the purchaser meeting the relevant eligibility criteria and government scheme conditions), presenting further potential to enhance its value.\r\n\r\nThe Area\r\n\r\nThe property is ideally situated on the outskirts of Smithborough Village, just off the N54 national primary route linking Monaghan Town and Cavan Town, providing excellent connectivity to both county towns.\r\n\r\nA primary school and preschool are within easy walking distance, while the local GAA grounds are also close by. Everyday amenities in the village include a filling station with convenience store, public house, takeaway, and a range of other essential local services, making this an ideal location for families and commuters alike.\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is highly recommended and is strictly by appointment through MPS.\r\n\r\nGround Floor\r\nEntrance Hall\t\t\t\t\t4.23m x 1.80m\r\nSitting Room\t\t\t\t\t3.85m x 3.44m\r\nLiving / Dining Room\t\t\t\t3.85m x 2.50m\r\nKitchen \t\t\t\t               1.80m x 2.36m\r\n\r\nFirst Floor\r\nLanding\t\t\t\t\t\t2.27m x 2.36m\r\nBedroom 1\t\t\t\t\t3.40m x 2.84m\r\nBedroom 2\t\t\t\t\t2.62m x 3.40m\r\nBedroom 3\t\t\t\t\t2.37m x 2.69m\r\nShower room\t\t\t\t\t1.46m x 2.33m\r\n\r\nExternals\r\nOutside W.C / Storage Shed \t\t\t2.20m x 1.95m"
      },
